 'Color & Tone':['Exposure','Contrast','White Balance','Lift / Gamma / Gain','Curves','HSL Secondary','Vibrance','Saturation','Film LUT','Teal & Orange','Film Print','Bleach Bypass','Day for Night','Black & White','Sepia'],
